{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HyperTyper 2000 is a unique typing/bullet hell roguelike where both halves of the action are nonstop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 5,000 words can be typed with the left half of the keyboard - leaving your right hand free to dodge!\u00a0Test your typing skills with one hand and dodge with the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/b2d9c02496ace60fcfbc4a045afdd170.poster.avif?t=1773133503\" width=776 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/b2d9c02496ace60fcfbc4a045afdd170.webm?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/b2d9c02496ace60fcfbc4a045afdd170.mp4?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a randomized dungeon to collect upgrades and fight challenging bosses, or shoot for a high score in Endless by surviving as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/736a5d38deef69da737da32347f6defb.poster.avif?t=1773133503\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/736a5d38deef69da737da32347f6defb.webm?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/736a5d38deef69da737da32347f6defb.mp4?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring pounding electronic music and stylized ASCII-art visuals, HyperTyper 2000 also lets you hone your typing skills with an adjustable Assist Mode to slow down the pace, limit word length, and more! Not enough of a challenge? Do the opposite, and amp up the game speed while making the words even longer! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type any word to attack an enemy from any distance - hit another enemy while a projectile is close by to parry it and send it flying back to the attacker! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through progressively harder challenges, or shoot for a new high score in a classic arcade mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125430?t=1773133503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773133503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/78267e4464c1564fb23c6b65d615557752ce6e75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773133503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/78267e4464c1564fb23c6b65d615557752ce6e75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773133503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3973910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HyperTyper 2000 is a unique typing/bullet hell roguelike where both halves of the action are nonstop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 5,000 words can be typed with the left half of the keyboard - leaving your right hand free to dodge!\u00a0Test your typing skills with one hand and dodge with the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/b2d9c02496ace60fcfbc4a045afdd170.poster.avif?t=1773133503\" width=776 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/b2d9c02496ace60fcfbc4a045afdd170.webm?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/b2d9c02496ace60fcfbc4a045afdd170.mp4?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a randomized dungeon to collect upgrades and fight challenging bosses, or shoot for a high score in Endless by surviving as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/736a5d38deef69da737da32347f6defb.poster.avif?t=1773133503\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/736a5d38deef69da737da32347f6defb.webm?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/extras/736a5d38deef69da737da32347f6defb.mp4?t=1773133503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring pounding electronic music and stylized ASCII-art visuals, HyperTyper 2000 also lets you hone your typing skills with an adjustable Assist Mode to slow down the pace, limit word length, and more! Not enough of a challenge? Do the opposite, and amp up the game speed while making the words even longer! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type any word to attack an enemy from any distance - hit another enemy while a projectile is close by to parry it and send it flying back to the attacker! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through progressively harder challenges, or shoot for a new high score in a classic arcade mode.</p>","developers":["NanoBoss Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/c1b6380d2686cec97a8f3a2e64353fc26b293760/header.jpg?t=1773133503","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125430/1646901646/d32cac56dac6e157f5d57933731ac2f3aae7dc53/1769821443/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769842039","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125430/1646901646/d32cac56dac6e157f5d57933731ac2f3aae7dc53/1769821443/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769842039","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125430/1646901646/d32cac56dac6e157f5d57933731ac2f3aae7dc53/1769821443/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769842039","id":257275832,"name":"HyperTyper 2000 Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257275832/f220117f4454b3faee541fa9ce545b2f4bfe4df8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769842039"}],"name":"HyperTyper 2000","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Yes</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NanoBoss Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe different upgrades are well-balanced, the controls are simple but tricky, ... the soundtrack slaps, and the balance between bullet hell and typing game is absolutely addictive. A regular bullet hell gives me anxiety and I panic and fold, but Hyper Typer 2000 makes me want to come back and get that high score every time. I played the demo far more than I had to to do this review, and it\u2019s just because it\u2019s that fun.\u201d<br>Culture Combine<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/ss_3aa79b6b6988e77894d58301a970c2f6c7b3c8a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773133503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/ss_3aa79b6b6988e77894d58301a970c2f6c7b3c8a4.600x338.jpg?t=1773133503"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/70456b2900689ed3e00765efd6d41da109a1b3f9/ss_70456b2900689ed3e00765efd6d41da109a1b3f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773133503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/70456b2900689ed3e00765efd6d41da109a1b3f9/ss_70456b2900689ed3e00765efd6d41da109a1b3f9.600x338.jpg?t=1773133503"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/85ff2cc663b3a7a6ca9d5ab4865f7da74080b3c7/ss_85ff2cc663b3a7a6ca9d5ab4865f7da74080b3c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773133503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/85ff2cc663b3a7a6ca9d5ab4865f7da74080b3c7/ss_85ff2cc663b3a7a6ca9d5ab4865f7da74080b3c7.600x338.jpg?t=1773133503"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/a3fcd6b559450ff44bfbf56ec20b69123099ec8c/ss_a3fcd6b559450ff44bfbf56ec20b69123099ec8c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773133503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/a3fcd6b559450ff44bfbf56ec20b69123099ec8c/ss_a3fcd6b559450ff44bfbf56ec20b69123099ec8c.600x338.jpg?t=1773133503"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/0a922a08299d8b571d93fc50a66b2fccca3c4453/ss_0a922a08299d8b571d